    "Raw injected-population files (results/_archive/run_20260707_seed3000/simulations/injections/*.csv) are UNREACHABLE: dangling symlinks to a cluster-only workspace path (/pfs/work9/workspace/scratch/st_ac147838-emri/injection_pool_depth15_50k/), not present on this machine. Bin edges therefore use the union of kept (CRB-CSV) and timeout-log parameters as the population proxy, not the raw injected draw -- disclosed, not substituted silently.",
